---
const title = 'Proper Energy — Solar Operations';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#101c1a" /><meta name="description" content="Proper Energy Solar Operations — dashboard demo untuk monitoring PLTS, penanganan alarm, dan pelaporan energi." />
<title>{title}</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" /><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/proper-dashboard.css" />
<script is:inline src="/proper-dashboard.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app-shell" id="app">
  <aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar" aria-label="Navigasi utama">
    <a href="#overview" class="brand" aria-label="Proper Energy, kembali ke ringkasan"><span class="brand-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 44 44" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M23 5 11 23h11l-2 16 15-22H24l3-12Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span><span class="brand-word">proper<span>energy</span><small>OPERATIONS STUDIO</small></span></a>
    <div class="workspace"><span class="workspace-symbol">P</span><span><strong>Proper Energy</strong><small>Portfolio workspace</small></span><span class="chevron">⌄</span></div>
    <div class="nav-label">WORKSPACE</div>
    <nav class="nav-group">
      <button class="nav-item active" data-view="overview"><span class="nav-icon">◫</span>Ringkasan <span class="nav-kbd">G O</span></button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-view="sites"><span class="nav-icon">▦</span>Lokasi PLTS <span class="nav-number">6</span></button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-view="alerts"><span class="nav-icon">♧</span>Alarm & insiden <span class="nav-number alert-count">3</span></button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-view="workorders"><span class="nav-icon">▤</span>Work orders <span class="nav-number" id="workorder-count">2</span></button>
    </nav>
    <div class="nav-label">INTELLIGENCE</div>
    <nav class="nav-group">
      <button class="nav-item" data-view="analytics"><span class="nav-icon">⌁</span>Analitik energi</button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-view="finance"><span class="nav-icon">◈</span>Keuangan</button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-view="assistant"><span class="nav-icon">✳</span>AI assistant</button>
    </nav>
    <div class="nav-label">SYSTEM</div>
    <nav class="nav-group"><button class="nav-item" data-view="settings"><span class="nav-icon">⚙</span>Pengaturan</button></nav>
    <div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="support-card"><div class="support-title">Butuh perhatian</div><p><span class="small-light"></span><strong>3 insiden</strong> menunggu tindak lanjut</p><button id="side-review" class="text-link">Lihat prioritas <span>↗</span></button></div><div class="sidebar-profile"><div class="avatar">PE</div><span><strong>Operations Team</strong><small>Demo workspace</small></span><span class="chevron">···</span></div></div>
  </aside>
  <div class="main-column">
    <header class="topbar"><div class="topbar-left"><button id="mobile-menu" class="icon-button mobile-menu" aria-label="Buka navigasi" aria-expanded="false">☰</button><span id="breadcrumb">Workspace <span class="crumb-divider">/</span> Ringkasan</span><span class="demo-indicator"><span class="dot"></span> DEMO DATA</span></div><div class="topbar-actions"><span class="clock" id="live-clock"></span><button class="icon-button" id="quick-search" aria-label="Cari lokasi atau fitur" title="Cari (/)" >⌕</button><button class="icon-button" id="header-notify" aria-label="Lihat alarm" title="Lihat alarm">♧<i class="notification-dot"></i></button><span class="top-avatar">PE</span></div></header>
    <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
      <section class="view active-view" id="view-overview" aria-labelledby="overview-title">
        <div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">PORTFOLIO / OVERVIEW</div><h1 id="overview-title">Selamat siang, tim Proper Energy <span class="heading-sun">✳</span></h1><p>Pantau kondisi seluruh instalasi, temukan masalah, dan ambil tindakan dari satu tempat.</p></div><div class="heading-controls"><button class="button button-ghost" id="overview-export">↓ Ekspor laporan</button><button class="button button-dark" id="new-workorder">＋ Work order baru</button></div></div>
        <div class="context-row"><div class="context-left"><span class="status-pill"><span class="status-pulse"></span> Sistem demo aktif</span><span>6 lokasi terdaftar</span><span class="separator">·</span><span>Simulasi telemetri, bukan data inverter langsung</span></div><div class="context-right"><label for="site-filter">Lokasi</label><select id="site-filter"><option value="all">Semua lokasi</option><option value="bintaro">Bintaro Residence</option><option value="bsd">BSD Green Cove</option><option value="pondok">Pondok Indah</option><option value="alam">Alam Sutera</option><option value="kebayoran">Kebayoran Residences</option><option value="serpong">Serpong Garden</option></select></div></div>
        <div class="hero-grid"><article class="energy-hero"><div class="hero-meta"><span><span class="hero-sun">✳</span> ENERGY AT A GLANCE</span><span class="hero-pill">SIMULATED • 12:30</span></div><div class="energy-grid"><div><div class="hero-caption">Produksi energi saat ini</div><div class="energy-value"><span id="hero-power">48.6</span><small>kW</small></div><div class="hero-caption bottom-caption">Portofolio solar rooftop <span class="up-trend">↗ 8.2% vs estimasi</span></div></div><div class="energy-illustration" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 360 200" fill="none"><circle cx="272" cy="57" r="37" stroke="#E3F2B0" stroke-width="1.2" opacity=".7"/><circle cx="272" cy="57" r="21" fill="#E3F2B0" opacity=".9"/><path d="M10 156 103 112l89 19 80-38 83 23" stroke="#C4E793" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="m10 156 93-44 89 19 80-38 83 23v63H10z" fill="url(#greenFade)"/><path d="M53 174 118 143l123 20-54 30z" fill="#D9E9A6" opacity=".35"/><path d="M83 170 128 151l68 13-42 18zM111 161l45 9M137 154l42 13M97 166l44 9" stroke="#E3F2B0" stroke-width="1"/><defs><linearGradient id="greenFade" x1="0" y1="92" x2="0" y2="180"><stop stop-color="#D3EFA1" stop-opacity=".28"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#D3EFA1" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient></defs></svg></div></div><div class="hero-bottom"><span>☀ <strong>4 dari 6</strong> lokasi optimal</span><span>Terakhir disimulasikan <strong id="hero-sim-time">12:30</strong></span></div></article>
        <article class="attention-card"><div class="section-top"><span class="card-overline">PRIORITAS HARI INI</span><span class="attention-icon">↗</span></div><strong class="attention-number">03 <span>insiden</span></strong><p>2 membutuhkan pemeriksaan teknisi, 1 perlu pemantauan.</p><button class="button attention-action" id="attention-review">Tinjau insiden <span>↗</span></button><div class="attention-foot"><span class="attention-stack">● ● ●</span><span>Jangan biarkan isu kecil jadi downtime.</span></div></article></div>
        <div class="metric-grid"><article class="metric-card"><div class="metric-title">Energi hari ini <span>↗</span></div><div class="metric-value" id="metric-energy">218.4 <small>kWh</small></div><div class="metric-foot"><span class="good-text">↑ 6.4%</span> dibanding target simulasi</div><div class="metric-spark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 180 34" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M0 28 20 23 39 26 61 13 83 20 105 9 128 13 151 5 180 8"/></svg></div></article><article class="metric-card"><div class="metric-title">Ketersediaan sistem <span>◎</span></div><div class="metric-value" id="metric-uptime">98.2 <small>%</small></div><div class="metric-foot">5 lokasi online <span class="muted-separator">·</span> 1 perlu pengecekan</div><div class="thin-progress"><span style="width:98.2%"></span></div></article><article class="metric-card"><div class="metric-title">Estimasi penghematan <span>◈</span></div><div class="metric-value" id="metric-saving">Rp 2,84 <small>jt</small></div><div class="metric-foot">Estimasi bulan ini, bukan tagihan PLN</div><div class="metric-bottom-tag">↗ Dasar asumsi tarif di Keuangan</div></article><article class="metric-card"><div class="metric-title">Kapasitas terpasang <span>↗</span></div><div class="metric-value" id="metric-capacity">65.0 <small>kWp</small></div><div class="metric-foot">6 lokasi <span class="muted-separator">·</span> 6 model inverter</div><div class="metric-bottom-tag">Portfolio capacity</div></article></div>
        <div class="content-grid"><article class="panel production-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="card-overline">ENERGY INTELLIGENCE</div><h2>Produksi & konsumsi</h2><p>Profil simulasi harian — dalam kW</p></div><div class="toggle-group" role="group" aria-label="Rentang grafik"><button class="time-range selected" data-range="day">Hari</button><button class="time-range" data-range="week">Minggu</button><button class="time-range" data-range="month">Bulan</button></div></div><div class="chart-key"><span><i style="background:#4B826D"></i> Produksi PLTS</span><span><i style="background:#DBB36B"></i> Konsumsi</span></div><div class="chart-container"><div class="chart-y"><span>60</span><span>45</span><span>30</span><span>15</span><span>0</span></div><div class="chart-body"><svg id="energy-chart" viewBox="0 0 680 230" role="img" aria-label="Grafik produksi dan konsumsi simulasi" preserveAspectRatio="none"></svg><div class="chart-x" id="chart-labels"><span>00:00</span><span>04:00</span><span>08:00</span><span>12:00</span><span>16:00</span><span>20:00</span><span>24:00</span></div></div></div><div class="chart-footer"><span>Model demonstrasi, tidak terhubung ke data inverter</span><button class="text-link" data-go="analytics">Buka analitik lengkap ↗</button></div></article><article class="panel health-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="card-overline">FLEET HEALTH</div><h2>Status instalasi</h2><p>Enam lokasi dalam satu tampilan</p></div><button class="text-link" data-go="sites">Lihat semua ↗</button></div><div class="site-mini-list" id="mini-site-list"></div><div class="health-footer"><span><i class="legend-dot online"></i> Optimal</span><span><i class="legend-dot warning"></i> Perhatian</span><span><i class="legend-dot offline"></i> Offline</span></div></article></div>
        <article class="panel action-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="card-overline">ACTION CENTER</div><h2>Perlu ditindaklanjuti</h2><p>Urutkan pekerjaan berdasarkan dampak, bukan sekadar notifikasi.</p></div><button class="text-link" data-go="alerts">Lihat semua insiden ↗</button></div><div id="overview-alerts"></div></article>
      </section>
      <section class="view" id="view-sites" aria-labelledby="sites-title"><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">ASSETS / SOLAR SITES</div><h1 id="sites-title">Seluruh lokasi PLTS</h1><p>Ringkasan kesehatan setiap instalasi. Pilih lokasi untuk melihat detail.</p></div><button class="button button-ghost" id="sites-export">↓ Ekspor daftar</button></div><div class="page-tools"><input id="site-search" placeholder="Cari lokasi, inverter, atau area…" aria-label="Cari lokasi" /><select id="site-status-filter" aria-label="Filter status"><option value="all">Semua status</option><option value="optimal">Optimal</option><option value="warning">Perhatian</option><option value="offline">Offline</option></select></div><div class="site-card-grid" id="site-grid"></div><article class="panel detail-panel" id="site-detail" hidden></article></section>
      <section class="view" id="view-alerts" aria-labelledby="alerts-title"><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">OPERATIONS / INCIDENTS</div><h1 id="alerts-title">Alarm & insiden</h1><p>Triase masalah dari sinyal pertama sampai penyelesaian.</p></div><button class="button button-dark" id="alerts-create-order">＋ Buat work order</button></div><div class="notice-banner"><strong>Demo workflow</strong> — insiden dan perubahan status tersimpan di browser ini saja. Belum ada sinkronisasi dengan perangkat atau sistem tiket produksi.</div><div class="filter-tabs" id="alert-filters"><button class="filter-tab active" data-status="all">Semua</button><button class="filter-tab" data-status="open">Terbuka</button><button class="filter-tab" data-status="acknowledged">Ditinjau</button><button class="filter-tab" data-status="resolved">Selesai</button></div><div class="panel list-panel" id="alerts-list"></div></section>
      <section class="view" id="view-workorders" aria-labelledby="workorders-title"><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">OPERATIONS / FIELD SERVICE</div><h1 id="workorders-title">Work orders</h1><p>Catat pekerjaan, PIC, prioritas, dan progres kunjungan teknisi.</p></div><button class="button button-dark" id="workorders-create">＋ Work order baru</button></div><div class="metric-grid three"><article class="metric-card"><div class="metric-title">Total tugas</div><div class="metric-value" id="wo-total">0</div></article><article class="metric-card"><div class="metric-title">Sedang dikerjakan</div><div class="metric-value" id="wo-active">0</div></article><article class="metric-card"><div class="metric-title">Selesai</div><div class="metric-value" id="wo-done">0</div></article></div><div class="panel list-panel" id="workorders-list"></div></section>
      <section class="view" id="view-analytics" aria-labelledby="analytics-title"><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">INTELLIGENCE / ANALYTICS</div><h1 id="analytics-title">Analitik energi</h1><p>Bandingkan kapasitas, potensi output, dan kualitas data sebelum bertindak.</p></div><button class="button button-ghost" id="analytics-export">↓ Ekspor data</button></div><div class="notice-banner"><strong>Methodology</strong> — semua nilai di halaman ini adalah ilustrasi yang dihitung dari dataset demo. Performance Ratio yang valid membutuhkan irradiance, energi, dan kapasitas terukur dengan interval dan timestamp konsisten.</div><div class="content-grid"><article class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="card-overline">CAPACITY MIX</div><h2>Distribusi kapasitas</h2></div></div><div id="capacity-bars" class="capacity-bars"></div></article><article class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="card-overline">QUALITY SIGNALS</div><h2>Kualitas operasional</h2></div></div><div class="insight-list"><div><span>Site memerlukan perhatian</span><strong>2 / 6</strong></div><div><span>Site tanpa koneksi data live</span><strong>6 / 6</strong></div><div><span>Riwayat audit cloud</span><strong>Belum tersedia</strong></div><div><span>Prediksi terkalibrasi</span><strong>Belum tersedia</strong></div></div><div class="analytics-note">Prioritas berikutnya: pipeline ingestion resmi, quality flags, interval historis dan baseline prediksi yang bisa diverifikasi.</div></article></div></section>
      <section class="view" id="view-finance" aria-labelledby="finance-title"><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">BUSINESS / VALUE</div><h1 id="finance-title">Keuangan & nilai energi</h1><p>Simulasi nilai ekonomi dari energi yang digunakan sendiri.</p></div><button class="button button-ghost" id="finance-export">↓ Ekspor kalkulasi</button></div><div class="content-grid"><article class="panel calc-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="card-overline">SAVINGS ESTIMATOR</div><h2>Estimasi penghematan</h2><p>Sesuaikan asumsi untuk melihat dampak dalam Rupiah.</p></div></div><div class="form-grid"><label>Produksi bulanan (kWh)<input type="number" id="calc-kwh" value="2100" min="0" step="10" /></label><label>Pemakaian sendiri (%)<input type="number" id="calc-self" value="80" min="0" max="100" step="1" /></label><label>Tarif efektif (Rp/kWh)<input type="number" id="calc-rate" value="1699" min="0" step="1" /></label><label>Biaya O&M bulanan (Rp)<input type="number" id="calc-om" value="200000" min="0" step="10000" /></label></div><div class="calc-result"><span>Manfaat bersih estimasi / bulan</span><strong id="calc-result">Rp 2.654.320</strong><small>Ilustrasi, bukan angka tagihan atau jaminan penghematan.</small></div></article><article class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><div class="card-overline">ASSUMPTIONS</div><h2>Metodologi terbuka</h2></div></div><div class="insight-list"><div><span>Energi terpakai sendiri</span><strong id="calc-used">1.680 kWh</strong></div><div><span>Nilai energi kotor</span><strong id="calc-gross">Rp 2.854.320</strong></div><div><span>Biaya operasi</span><strong id="calc-cost">Rp 200.000</strong></div></div><p class="method-paragraph">Rumus: produksi × persentase konsumsi sendiri × tarif efektif − biaya O&M. Ekspor ke PLN, struktur tarif, pajak, degradasi panel, pembiayaan, dan kebijakan setempat belum dimodelkan.</p></article></div></section>
      <section class="view" id="view-assistant" aria-labelledby="assistant-title"><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">INTELLIGENCE / COPILOT</div><h1 id="assistant-title">Proper AI assistant</h1><p>Asisten operasional untuk membaca konteks demo dan menyusun tindakan berikutnya.</p></div><div class="assistant-layout"><div class="panel assistant-panel"><div class="assistant-status"><span class="assistant-star">✳</span><div><strong>Operations copilot</strong><small id="assistant-mode">Mode panduan lokal — tanpa koneksi AI</small></div></div><div id="chat-log" class="chat-log" aria-live="polite"><div class="chat-message ai">Halo. Saya bisa bantu merangkum prioritas insiden, memahami kinerja simulasi, dan menyiapkan langkah pemeriksaan. Untuk diagnosis lapangan, verifikasi data pada perangkat dan teknisi tetap diperlukan.</div></div><form id="chat-form" class="chat-form"><label class="sr-only" for="chat-input">Pesan</label><input id="chat-input" placeholder="Tanyakan status PLTS atau tindak lanjut…" required maxlength="1000" /><button class="button button-dark" type="submit">Kirim ↗</button></form></div><aside class="panel prompt-panel"><div class="card-overline">QUICK START</div><h2>Mulai dari pertanyaan</h2><button class="prompt-button" data-prompt="Apa insiden prioritas hari ini?">Apa insiden prioritas hari ini? ↗</button><button class="prompt-button" data-prompt="Bagaimana cara cek inverter offline?">Bagaimana cara cek inverter offline? ↗</button><button class="prompt-button" data-prompt="Bagaimana menghitung penghematan PLTS?">Bagaimana menghitung penghematan PLTS? ↗</button><div class="notice-banner small">Jawaban fallback berbasis panduan statis, bukan AI live. Endpoint server dan akses model belum diverifikasi.</div></aside></div></section>
      <section class="view" id="view-settings" aria-labelledby="settings-title"><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">WORKSPACE / PREFERENCES</div><h1 id="settings-title">Pengaturan</h1><p>Personalisasi pengalaman demo ini di perangkat lokal.</p></div><div class="panel settings-panel"><h2>Preferensi tampilan</h2><div class="settings-row"><div><strong>Mode tampilan</strong><p>Kontras lebih tinggi untuk monitoring di ruang kontrol.</p></div><label class="switch"><input id="contrast-toggle" type="checkbox" /><span></span></label></div><div class="settings-row"><div><strong>Kurangi animasi</strong><p>Nonaktifkan transisi dekoratif.</p></div><label class="switch"><input id="motion-toggle" type="checkbox" /><span></span></label></div><div class="settings-row"><div><strong>Reset data demo</strong><p>Hapus perubahan status insiden dan work order pada browser ini.</p></div><button class="button button-ghost" id="reset-data">Reset demo</button></div></div><div class="notice-banner">Login, RBAC, tenant isolation, audit trail, dan integrasi inverter belum diimplementasikan di patch frontend ini. Jangan gunakan data demo untuk keputusan produksi.</div></section>
    </main>
    <footer class="footer"><span>© 2026 Proper Energy. Solar Operations Studio.</span><span>Prototype frontend · Simulated data · Local-first patch</span></footer>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="overlay" id="mobile-overlay" hidden></div>
<div class="modal-backdrop" id="modal-backdrop" hidden><div class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modal-title"><div class="modal-top"><div><div class="card-overline">FIELD OPERATIONS</div><h2 id="modal-title">Work order baru</h2></div><button class="icon-button" id="modal-close" aria-label="Tutup form">×</button></div><form id="workorder-form"><label>Judul pekerjaan<input name="title" placeholder="Contoh: Periksa koneksi inverter" required maxlength="120" /></label><div class="form-grid"><label>Lokasi<select name="site" required><option value="">Pilih lokasi</option><option>Bintaro Residence</option><option>BSD Green Cove</option><option>Pondok Indah</option><option>Alam Sutera</option><option>Kebayoran Residences</option><option>Serpong Garden</option></select></label><label>Prioritas<select name="priority"><option>Normal</option><option>Tinggi</option><option>Urgent</option></select></label></div><label>Penanggung jawab<input name="assignee" placeholder="Nama teknisi / PIC" required maxlength="80" /></label><label>Catatan<textarea name="notes" rows="3" placeholder="Deskripsi tindakan dan hal yang perlu dicek" maxlength="500"></textarea></label><div class="modal-actions"><button class="button button-ghost" id="modal-cancel" type="button">Batal</button><button class="button button-dark" type="submit">Simpan work order</button></div></form></div></div>
<div id="toast" class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
</body></html>
